  "implementation": {
    "cache": "Process-local bounded LRU shared by newly constructed adapters/transports; 16 entries and 64MiB encoded metadata. No persisted trust marker or new state file. Full verification on miss, absent digest, changed run/index identity/digest or restart. HTTP host/token namespace, storage root and source isolate reuse. Metadata admitted only after source/schema/time/status/item coverage/bundle digest verification and agreement with the live index digest.",
    "eviction": "LRU/byte bound; replaced run identity/digest evicts its old entry after full verification; prior trading sessions are evicted when a newer session is selected. Same-session runs remain bounded and available for omitted-instrument union/rollback safety.",
    "verification": "Each delivered raw item still downloads and verifies its hash/declared size; existing raw-to-native-row and record contract checks run before persistence and acknowledgement.",
    "rollback": "Existing latest_priority.json and resume cursor formats unchanged. Actual bee62bc29 and 0940f6248 reader tests parse new acknowledgements."
